<b>Abbreviations</b>:
<ul>
<li><b>EDNS</b> - Employer Did Not State, i.e., the employer did not provide the 
information to EDD in the WARN notice submitted.<br>
<li><b>#</b> - Use of the number sign (#) indicates the number of employees laid off in each job title.
</ul>

<b>Note:</b>
<br>
Due to Web space limitations, only a maximum of 50 job titles are listed under each Company WARN notice. 
Job titles are reproduced as submitted to EDD by the employer in the WARN notice.
<br><br>
A labor union or multiple labor unions may be listed under a Company's WARN notice, however, 
not all job titles may be covered by the union(s). 

